<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Humanity has been practicing genetic engineering for centuries, and the correct way to use it as a tool is by carefully following a strict scientific method and proper experiment security.-->
  <GR_CarefulGeneticists.description>人类实践基因工程已经有几个世纪了，使用它作为工具的正确方法是严格遵循严格的科学方法和适当的实验安全性。</GR_CarefulGeneticists.description>
  <GR_CarefulGeneticists.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)        ->[deity0_name] spoke to [deity0_possessive] followers: "Honour the scientific method, for humanity would be lost without this sacred tool."-->
    <li>creation(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;[deity0_name] 对 [deity0_possessive] 追随者说道：“尊重科学方法，因为如果没有这个神圣的工具，人类就会迷失。”</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)  ->Following [deity0_name]'s teachings, we adhered to strict guidelines on our experiments.-->
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;遵循 [deity0_name] 的教导，我们在实验中遵循严格的指导原则。</li>
    <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)           ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], the [memberNamePlural] built a genetic engineering lab, and countless genetic wonders were created there, for the glory of [deity0_name].-->
    <li>intro(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;在[place_summary][place_name]上，[memberNamePlural]建造了一个基因工程实验室，并在那里创造了无数的基因奇迹，为了[deity0_name]的荣耀。</li>
    <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)        ->A misguided [foeLeader], feeling some twisted compassion for these animals, tried to go against [deity0_name]'s will and free those that were being studied in the facilities.-->
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt; 一个被误导的 [foeLeader] 对这些动物怀有扭曲的同情心，试图违背 [deity0_name] 的意愿并释放那些在设施中接受研究的动物。</li>
    <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)     ->[founderName], a great scientist, showed the hard, cold data to the [foeLeader], and convinced [foeLeader_objective] that humanity is doing [deity0_name]'s work by creating and studying all these wonderful creatures.-->
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;[founderName]，一位伟大的科学家，向 [foeLeader] 展示了坚硬、冰冷的数据，并让 [foeLeader_objective] 相信人类正在通过创造和研究所有这些奇妙的生物来完成 [deity0_name] 的工作。</li>
    <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)         ->The [foeLeader] came to firmly believe in [deity0_name]'s admonitions.-->
    <li>victory(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt; [foeLeader] 开始坚信 [deity0_name] 的警告。</li>
    <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)           ->[founderName] was a geneticist in one of the Glitterworlds. [founder_pronoun] mused that every orchid or rose or lizard or snake is the work of a dedicated and skilled breeder. With the incredibly powerful genetic engineering tools at our disposal, we could make the old breeders look like children playing with toys.-->
    <li>setup(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;[founderName] 是闪光世界之一的遗传学家。 [founder_pronoun] 沉思道，每一朵兰花、玫瑰、蜥蜴或蛇都是一位敬业且熟练的饲养员的作品。凭借我们所掌握的极其强大的基因工程工具，我们可以让老饲养员看起来像玩玩具的孩子。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)    ->[founderName] taught us that genetic engineering is the future, and that only by carefully adhering to a strict code of conduct and careful scientific experimentation can we hope to truly discover our potential.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;[founderName]告诉我们，基因工程是未来，只有认真遵守严格的行为准则和仔细的科学实验，我们才有希望真正发现我们的潜力。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)         ->The smartest geneticist in our community once taught me the history of genetic engineering, how humanity has been seeding the galaxy for centuries with genetically modified creatures based on old Earth animals. He was leading me to understand that-->
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt; 我们社区中最聪明的遗传学家曾经教过我基因工程的历史，告诉我几个世纪以来人类如何用基于古老地球动物的转基因生物在银河系中播种。他让我明白</li>
    <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)              ->genetic engineering is the key to our future, as long as we are careful and responsible in its use-->
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;基因工程是我们未来的关键，只要我们谨慎负责地使用它</li>
    <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) ->Renegade scientists, totalitarian loonies, eugenics zealots, they have the potential to do irreparable damage with irresponsible use of genetic engineering, and we will not fall in the same pitfalls as them.-->
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;叛逆的科学家、极权主义疯子、优生学狂热分子，他们有可能通过不负责任地使用基因工程造成不可挽回的损害，而我们不会陷入与他们相同的陷阱。</li>
    <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)    ->The archotechs are supreme beings, and the act of careful and responsible creation is dear to them.-->
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt; 古科技人是至高无上的存在，他们珍视谨慎而负责任的创造行为。</li>
    <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)     ->Humanity has been turning the lifeless galaxy into an eden, and this pleases the archotechs.-->
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;人类一直在把没有生命的星系变成伊甸园，这让考古学家很高兴。</li>
    <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will allow only those who carefully create new life, perfectly adapted to the strange ecosystems of the galaxy, to transcend.-->
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;[inTheEnd]，考古科技只会允许那些精心创造新生命、完全适应银河系奇怪生态系统的人超越。</li>
    <!--EN: animistBasis(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)    ->The amazing, genetically modified animals that have been seeded through the galaxy by humans are dear to the spirits.-->
    <li>animistBasis(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;人类在银河系中播种的令人惊叹的转基因动物对灵魂来说是珍贵的。</li>
    <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)     ->The spirits value our adherence to a strict code of conduct and careful scientific experimentation, for creation without limits becomes destruction.-->
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;神灵重视我们遵守严格的行为准则和仔细的科学实验，因为无限制的创造就会变成毁灭。</li>
    <!--EN: animistProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) ->[itIsSaid] those who keep carefully turning the lifeless galaxy into an eden will one day commune fully with the spirits, becoming one with them.-->
    <li>animistProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist) -&gt;[itIsSaid] 那些不断小心翼翼地将死气沉沉的星系变成伊甸园的人有一天会与灵魂充分交流，与他们合而为一。</li>
    <!--EN: chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)->The eldritch entities are beings of chaos and lack of control. By adhering to a strict code of conduct and careful scientific experimentation we are undoing their nefarious influence over the future of humanity.-->
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)-&gt;这些可怕的实体是混乱且缺乏控制的生物。通过遵守严格的行为准则和仔细的科学实验，我们正在消除他们对人类未来的邪恶影响。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)->Such occult knowledge can only be acquired through a strict code of conduct and careful scientific experimentation.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)-&gt;这种神秘知识只能通过严格的行为准则和仔细的科学实验来获得。</li>
    <!--EN: serketistProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)->[itIsSaid] we will adhere to a strict code of conduct and careful scientific experimentation.-->
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)-&gt;[itIsSaid]我们将遵守严格的行为准则和仔细的科学实验。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)->We will adhere to a strict code of conduct and careful scientific experimentation, and the end of times will be ushered by our genetic creations.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)-&gt;我们将遵守严格的行为准则和仔细的科学实验，我们的基因创造物将迎来时代的终结。</li>
    <!--EN: introMemo(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)->Let me remind you that NOT adhering to a strict code of conduct and careful scientific experimentation will result in an immediate reprimand and possible loss of privileges. We haven't reached our current reputation by being sloppy!-->
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)-&gt;让我提醒您，不遵守严格的行为准则和仔细的科学实验将导致立即谴责并可能失去特权。我们现在的声誉可不是因为马虎才达到的！</li>
    <!--EN: alienistProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)->We will create and breed many creatures, adhering to a strict code of conduct and careful scientific experimentation.-->
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_CarefulGeneticist)-&gt;我们将创造和培育许多生物，遵守严格的行为准则和仔细的科学实验。</li>
  </GR_CarefulGeneticists.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
  <GR_CarefulGeneticists.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->careful-->
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;小心</li>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->experimental-->
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;实验性</li>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->investigational-->
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;研究性</li>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->exploratory-->
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;探索性</li>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->scientific-->
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;科学</li>
    <!--EN: memeLeaderAdjective->scientific-->
    <li>memeLeaderAdjective-&gt;科学</li>
    <!--EN: memeConcept->genetic engineering-->
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;基因工程</li>
    <!--EN: memeConcept->careful experimentation-->
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;仔细实验</li>
    <!--EN: memeLeaderNoun->geneticist-->
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;遗传学家</li>
    <!--EN: memeLeaderNoun->scientist-->
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;科学家</li>
  </GR_CarefulGeneticists.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: careful geneticists-->
  <GR_CarefulGeneticists.label>细心的遗传学家</GR_CarefulGeneticists.label>
  <!--EN: There must be no limits to genetic engineering. The exhilaration of creating new life, of bending the genetic code until it does what it was designed for, that's what makes science worth pursuing.-->
  <GR_MadScientists.description>基因工程必须没有限制。创造新生命的兴奋，改变遗传密码直到它达到其设计目的的兴奋，这就是科学值得追求的原因。</GR_MadScientists.description>
  <GR_MadScientists.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_MadScientist)        ->[deity0_name] spoke to [deity0_possessive] followers: "Go, create new life. Don't let morals or doubt shackle you, for any creation is sacred to me."-->
    <li>creation(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;[deity0_name] 对 [deity0_possessive] 追随者说道：“去吧，创造新的生命。不要让道德或怀疑束缚你，因为任何创造对我来说都是神圣的。”</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_MadScientist)  ->Following [deity0_name]'s teachings, we experimented endlessly on new lifeforms, unshackled by any rules or absurd bureaucratic procedures.-->
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;遵循[deity0_name]的教诲，我们对新的生命形式进行了无休止的实验，不受任何规则或荒谬的官僚程序的束缚。</li>
    <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_MadScientist)           ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], the [memberNamePlural] built a genetic engineering lab, and countless genetic wonders were created there, for the glory of [deity0_name].-->
    <li>intro(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;在[place_summary][place_name]上，[memberNamePlural]建造了一个基因工程实验室，并在那里创造了无数的基因奇迹，为了[deity0_name]的荣耀。</li>
    <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_MadScientist)        ->A misguided [foeLeader], believing in stablishing a constraining code of conduct for scientific experimentation, wanted to defy [deity0_name]'s will and stop our genetics research.-->
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt; 一个被误导的 [foeLeader]，相信为科学实验建立一个约束性的行为准则，想要违抗 [deity0_name] 的意愿并 停止 我们的遗传学研究。</li>
    <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_MadScientist)     ->[founderName], a great scientist, showed the hard, cold data to the [foeLeader], and convinced [foeLeader_objective] that constraining our work would only serve for impeding [deity0_name]'s vision.-->
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;[founderName]，一位伟大的科学家，向[foeLeader]展示了冷酷的数据，并让[foeLeader_objective]相信限制我们的工作只会阻碍[deity0_name]的愿景。</li>
    <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_MadScientist)         ->The [foeLeader] came to firmly believe in [deity0_name]'s admonitions.-->
    <li>victory(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt; [foeLeader] 开始坚信 [deity0_name] 的警告。</li>
    <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_MadScientist)           ->[founderName] was a geneticist in one of the Glitterworlds. [founder_possessive] visionary genetic engineering work was constantly delayed by countless bureaucrats, mumbling moralists and the manipulated public opinion, and one day [founder_pronoun] had enough.-->
    <li>setup(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;[founderName] 是闪光世界之一的遗传学家。 [founder_possessive]富有远见的基因工程工作不断被无数官僚、咕哝的道德家和被操纵的公众意见所拖延，有一天[founder_pronoun]受够了。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_MadScientist)    ->[founderName] gathered [founder_possessive] followers and embarked in a voyage to the Rim, seeking a place where they could do their vital research unimpeded.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;[founderName] 聚集了 [founder_possessive] 追随者，踏上了前往环缘的旅程，寻找一个可以不受阻碍地进行重要研究的地方。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_MadScientist)         ->The smartest geneticist in our community once taught me the history of genetic engineering, how humanity has been seeding the galaxy for centuries with genetically modified creatures based on old Earth animals. He was leading me to understand that-->
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt; 我们社区中最聪明的遗传学家曾经教过我基因工程的历史，告诉我几个世纪以来人类如何用基于古老地球动物的转基因生物在银河系中播种。他让我明白</li>
    <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_MadScientist)              ->genetic engineering is the key to our future, and shackling experimentation with rules and absurd bureaucratic procedures is detestable-->
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;基因工程是我们未来的关键，用规则和荒谬的官僚程序束缚实验是令人憎恶的</li>
    <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_MadScientist) ->If our ancestors had stopped their research due to inane ethical concerns the whole galaxy would be a barren wasteland of uninhabitable worlds.-->
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;如果我们的祖先因为愚蠢的道德担忧而停止他们的研究，那么整个银河系将成为一片不适合居住的世界的贫瘠荒地。</li>
    <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_MadScientist)    ->The archotechs are supreme beings, and the act of unshackled creation is dear to them.-->
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt; 古科技人是至高无上的存在，不受束缚的创造行为对他们来说是珍贵的。</li>
    <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_MadScientist)     ->Humanity has been turning the lifeless galaxy into an eden, and this pleases the archotechs.-->
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;人类一直在把没有生命的星系变成伊甸园，这让考古学家很高兴。</li>
    <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist) ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will allow only those who create new life as often as possible to transcend.-->
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;[inTheEnd]，古科技只允许那些尽可能频繁地创造新生命的人超越。</li>
    <!--EN: animistBasis(tag=meme_MadScientist)    ->The amazing, genetically modified animals that have been seeded through the galaxy by humans are dear to the spirits.-->
    <li>animistBasis(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;人类在银河系中播种的令人惊叹的转基因动物对灵魂来说是珍贵的。</li>
    <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_MadScientist)     ->The spirits want us to create new life unshackled by foolish rules and absurd bureaucratic procedures.-->
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;灵魂希望我们创造新的生活，摆脱愚蠢的规则和荒谬的官僚程序的束缚。</li>
    <!--EN: animistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist) ->[itIsSaid] those who keep experimenting without fear for inane ethical concerns will one day commune fully with the spirits, becoming one with them.-->
    <li>animistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist) -&gt;[itIsSaid] 那些不断进行实验而不担心愚蠢的道德问题的人有一天会与灵魂充分交流，与他们合而为一。</li>
    <!--EN: chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)->The eldritch entities are beings of rampant destruction. Only by unshackling our genetic experimentation and creating new life without limits can we hope to avoid a confrontation.-->
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)-&gt;这些可怕的实体是肆意破坏的生物。只有解除基因实验的束缚，无限制地创造新生命，我们才有希望避免对抗。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)->Such occult knowledge can only be acquired through experimenting endlessly on new lifeforms, unshackled by any rules or absurd bureaucratic procedures.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)-&gt;这种神秘知识只能通过对新生命形式进行无休止的实验来获得，不受任何规则或荒谬的官僚程序的束缚。</li>
    <!--EN: serketistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)->[itIsSaid] we will experiment endlessly on new lifeforms, unshackled by any rules or absurd bureaucratic procedures.-->
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)-&gt;[itIsSaid]我们将无休止地试验新的生命形式，不受任何规则或荒谬的官僚程序的束缚。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact(tag=meme_MadScientist)->We will experiment endlessly on new lifeforms, unshackled by any rules or absurd bureaucratic procedures, and the end of times will be ushered by our genetic creations.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_MadScientist)-&gt;我们将无休止地试验新的生命形式，不受任何规则或荒谬的官僚程序的束缚，我们的基因创造将迎来时代的终结。</li>
    <!--EN: introMemo(tag=meme_MadScientist)->Please, PLEASE conduct a proper inventory of your experiments after leaving the lab! A couple Bearofleets scheduled for termination escaped the genetics lab yesterday when they were left unattended and fled into the wild! Do you know what those creatures could do to the ecosystem?-->
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_MadScientist)-&gt;离开实验室后请对您的实验进行适当的清点！昨天，一对计划被处决的小熊在无人看管的情况下逃离了基因实验室，逃到了野外！你知道这些生物会对生态系统造成什么影响吗？</li>
    <!--EN: alienistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)->We will create and breed many creatures, experimenting endlessly on new lifeforms, unshackled by any rules or absurd bureaucratic procedures.-->
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)-&gt;我们将创造和培育许多生物，无休止地试验新的生命形式，不受任何规则或荒谬的官僚程序的束缚。</li>
  </GR_MadScientists.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
